{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/d3294eb3445725c23aba9bed9d2053a4.avif?t=1757989305\" width=1290 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Haetae: Guardians&gt; is a fantasy action-adventure game set in Joseon, the Korean dynasty (1392\u20131910).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Four Guardian Beasts, who once protected the land from evil spirits, have gone astray. As their power fades, monsters begin to appear across Joseon, bringing chaos to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the crisis, the protagonist is chosen by the Yellow Dragon and sets off on a journey with Haetae, the mythical beast, to purify the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the corrupted guardians and the hidden secrets that led to the disaster in this epic tale of purification and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae: Guardians offers intuitive and simple controls, making the action accessible yet deeply engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge with generous timing windows and immerse yourself in the game's tense, challenging combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae\u2019s skills possess purifying power. When used effectively against bosses and elite monsters, they can put enemies into a stunned (groggy) state after dealing enough damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique action and strategic gameplay using both the protagonist and Haetae. Each character can be developed in different ways, allowing for various build combinations and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2854210?t=1757989305","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2854210?t=1757989305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/ead086d26c05bf078daf5fc77e912f88659e1b90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757989305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/ead086d26c05bf078daf5fc77e912f88659e1b90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757989305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/d3294eb3445725c23aba9bed9d2053a4.avif?t=1757989305\" width=1290 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Haetae: Guardians&gt; is a fantasy action-adventure game set in Joseon, the Korean dynasty (1392\u20131910).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Four Guardian Beasts, who once protected the land from evil spirits, have gone astray. As their power fades, monsters begin to appear across Joseon, bringing chaos to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the crisis, the protagonist is chosen by the Yellow Dragon and sets off on a journey with Haetae, the mythical beast, to purify the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the corrupted guardians and the hidden secrets that led to the disaster in this epic tale of purification and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae: Guardians offers intuitive and simple controls, making the action accessible yet deeply engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge with generous timing windows and immerse yourself in the game's tense, challenging combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae\u2019s skills possess purifying power. When used effectively against bosses and elite monsters, they can put enemies into a stunned (groggy) state after dealing enough damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique action and strategic gameplay using both the protagonist and Haetae. Each character can be developed in different ways, allowing for various build combinations and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["JipangYiGames.Corp"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/d345b99759f044465569ab30455d9fe61766af37/header.jpg?t=1757989305","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2854210/578401904/d5ebfcb740eaf93f2fd5b1ff14d48bc4fd5432a7/1753767615/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753769798","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2854210/578401904/d5ebfcb740eaf93f2fd5b1ff14d48bc4fd5432a7/1753767615/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753769798","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2854210/578401904/d5ebfcb740eaf93f2fd5b1ff14d48bc4fd5432a7/1753767615/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753769798","id":257073264,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257073264/movie480.mp4?t=1753769798","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257073264/movie_max.mp4?t=1753769798"},"name":"HaeTae: Guardians Promo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25707